        <title-group>
          <article-title lang="original"><![CDATA[사르트르와 들뢰즈에게서의 상상(imagination)의 의미: 흄의 이미지 이론에 관한 해석을 중심으로]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="foreign"><![CDATA[The Meaning of the “lmagination” in Sartre and Deleuze: The Interpretation of Hume’s Image Theory]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="english"><![CDATA[The Meaning of the “lmagination” in Sartre and Deleuze: The Interpretation of Hume’s Image Theory]]></article-title>
        </title-group>
        <author-group>
          <author author-division="1" author-part="단독">
